    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "breathing just feels like a chore. it doesn't fix the fact that i've lost everything. i'm just waiting for the end to find me, but it's taking too long. i look at the horizon and i don't see a future, elara. i just see a void. don't you think it's cruel to keep dragging someone through this when there's nothing left to save? why should i even bother pretending there's a way out?",
